{
    "title": "Spider Solitaire Deluxe\u00ae 2",
    "description": "Spider is one of the most popular types of solitaire in the world and Spider Solitaire Deluxe\u00ae 2 is the premium way to enjoy it. \r\n\r\nHow to Play:\r\nSpider Solitaire is a classic card game where the objective is to build same-suit runs of cards in descending order from King to Ace. Players can move cards between piles on the tableau, aiming to complete sequences and remove them from the game. The game is won when all sequences are successfully built, showcasing strategic thinking and careful planning. Playing the Spider Solitaire game is easy if you like playing cards and especially if you\u2019re a pro at classic Spider games.\r\n\r\nPREMIUM SPIDER FEATURES\r\n\r\n- Varied Difficulty Levels: Tailor your card game to your skill level with adjustable difficulty settings. From casual to difficult, there's a level of challenge for every type of player. You can exercise your brain with three challenges: one, two, or four-suit Spider games.\r\n\r\n- Leaderboards: Compete on leaderboards by playing in a team, against the world\u2019s high scorers or with friends in an engaging weekly tournament. Showcase your skills and earn well-deserved bragging rights as the Spider Solitaire champion.\r\n\r\n- Beautiful HD Graphics: Enjoy sleek and modern design of the game with stylish graphics and a user-friendly interface. The game's aesthetics have been given a fresh and contemporary makeover, making it visually appealing and easy to navigate.\r\n\r\n- Exclusive Easy Read\u00ae cards: Enjoy clear and appropriately sized cards for effortless gameplay in Spider Solitaire game.\r\n\r\n- Winnable Deals \r\nPlay Spider Solitaire challenge and get unlimited guaranteed winnable deals, ensuring a satisfying gaming experience every time.\r\n\r\n- It\u2019s social: The premium features of Spider solitaire deluxe allow you to play the game with your friends on Facebook or play solo.\r\n\r\n- In-Game shop for exclusive cards & backgrounds: Customize themes, card fronts, card backs and backgrounds according to your choice by earning coins.\r\n\r\n- Collectible Stickers: Don't miss out on varied challenges that will push your solitaire skills to the limit. Completing these challenges not only demonstrates your expertise but also rewards you with stickers, ribbons that unlock exciting new content along the way.\r\n\r\n- Customer care: Spider Solitaire deluxe provides best-in-class customer care for any questions.\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy classic solitaire card games like Spades, Freecell and Rummy, as well as other Solitaire variants such as Klondike Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, Spiderette, then Spider Solitaire is definitely worth a try. Known for its entertaining gameplay, Spider Solitaire promises hours of fun for Solitaire enthusiasts.\r\nJoin millions of players from around the world and dive into the exciting world of Spider Solitaire. Download the game now to start your unforgettable adventure, designed by Murka's expert developers.\r\n\r\nLike us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/SpiderSolitaireDeluxe2",
    "descriptionHTML": "Spider is one of the most popular types of solitaire in the world and Spider Solitaire Deluxe\u00ae 2 is the premium way to enjoy it. <br><br>How to Play:<br>Spider Solitaire is a classic card game where the objective is to build same-suit runs of cards in descending order from King to Ace. Players can move cards between piles on the tableau, aiming to complete sequences and remove them from the game. The game is won when all sequences are successfully built, showcasing strategic thinking and careful planning. Playing the Spider Solitaire game is easy if you like playing cards and especially if you\u2019re a pro at classic Spider games.<br><br>PREMIUM SPIDER FEATURES<br><br>- Varied Difficulty Levels: Tailor your card game to your skill level with adjustable difficulty settings. From casual to difficult, there&#39;s a level of challenge for every type of player. You can exercise your brain with three challenges: one, two, or four-suit Spider games.<br><br>- Leaderboards: Compete on leaderboards by playing in a team, against the world\u2019s high scorers or with friends in an engaging weekly tournament. Showcase your skills and earn well-deserved bragging rights as the Spider Solitaire champion.<br><br>- Beautiful HD Graphics: Enjoy sleek and modern design of the game with stylish graphics and a user-friendly interface. The game&#39;s aesthetics have been given a fresh and contemporary makeover, making it visually appealing and easy to navigate.<br><br>- Exclusive Easy Read\u00ae cards: Enjoy clear and appropriately sized cards for effortless gameplay in Spider Solitaire game.<br><br>- Winnable Deals <br>Play Spider Solitaire challenge and get unlimited guaranteed winnable deals, ensuring a satisfying gaming experience every time.<br><br>- It\u2019s social: The premium features of Spider solitaire deluxe allow you to play the game with your friends on Facebook or play solo.<br><br>- In-Game shop for exclusive cards &amp; backgrounds: Customize themes, card fronts, card backs and backgrounds according to your choice by earning coins.<br><br>- Collectible Stickers: Don&#39;t miss out on varied challenges that will push your solitaire skills to the limit. Completing these challenges not only demonstrates your expertise but also rewards you with stickers, ribbons that unlock exciting new content along the way.<br><br>- Customer care: Spider Solitaire deluxe provides best-in-class customer care for any questions.<br><br>If you enjoy classic solitaire card games like Spades, Freecell and Rummy, as well as other Solitaire variants such as Klondike Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, Spiderette, then Spider Solitaire is definitely worth a try. Known for its entertaining gameplay, Spider Solitaire promises hours of fun for Solitaire enthusiasts.<br>Join millions of players from around the world and dive into the exciting world of Spider Solitaire. Download the game now to start your unforgettable adventure, designed by Murka&#39;s expert developers.<br><br>Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/SpiderSolitaireDeluxe2",
